From: ChopGimp <mathieu.redon@proton.me>
Subject: [PATCH] po: French translations for filter titles and layer style
 operations (Bevel, Inner Glow, Bloom, Lens Blur...)

The French GEGL catalog dates from 2019: the titles and menu labels of
recent operations (gimp:menu-label "Bevel...", "Inner Glow...") showed
in English in the French ChopGimp menus.
---
diff --git a/po/fr.po b/po/fr.po
index 5889358..9eaf0e2 100644
--- a/po/fr.po
+++ b/po/fr.po
@@ -9112,3 +9112,516 @@ msgstr "Diagramme de Voronoï"
 msgid "Paints each non-seed pixel with the color of the nearest seed pixel."
 msgstr ""
 "Peint chaque pixel non-germe avec la couleur du plus proche pixel germe."
